nclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134662722,imgsize-114608.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[1987 Buick GNX with 30 miles jumps from $200,000 to $427,000 in 2 years]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134636679.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-1987-buick-gnx-no-450-of-just-547-built-for-a-single-model-year-sold-for-200000-with-26-miles-in-2024-two-years-and-only-4-miles-later-the-30-mile-car-sold-again-for-427000/articleshow/134636679.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-1987-buick-gnx-no-450-of-just-547-built-for-a-single-model-year-sold-for-200000-with-26-miles-in-2024-two-years-and-only-4-miles-later-the-30-mile-car-sold-again-for-427000/articleshow/134636679.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-03T21:07:39+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134636724,imgsize-733079.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Georgia begins 10-year forest restoration at 132-acre Towaliga Preserve with data-centre partnership]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134638691.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[The Towaliga Preserve is about to launch an ambitious 10-year forest restoration project, backed by QTS Data Centres. This significant initiative aims to revitalize 132 acres, focusing on ecosystem management and biodiversity enhancement. Throughout the decade, contractors will engage in tasks like invasive species control and planting native trees. After the project, the Southern Conservation Trust will ensure the area remains cared for and healthy.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/nature/georgia-has-begun-a-10-year-restoration-of-132-acres-at-towaliga-preserve-using-a-data-centre-partnership-to-rebuild-forest-habitat-on-one-of-henry-countys-largest-undeveloped-properties/articleshow/134638691.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/nature/georgia-has-begun-a-10-year-restoration-of-132-acres-at-towaliga-preserve-using-a-data-centre-partnership-to-rebuild-forest-habitat-on-one-of-henry-countys-largest-undeveloped-properties/articleshow/134638691.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-03T21:07:12+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134638770,imgsize-1482218.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['No deadline for Sheikh Hasina's return', says Indian high commissioner in Bangladesh]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134661882.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[High Commissioner Dinesh Trivedi addressed the extradition request for Sheikh Hasina from Bangladesh, stating that the matter is under legal review, preventing a set timeline for her repatriation. He clarified that India had no involvement in her arrival, citing the dire circumstances in Bangladesh. As relations between India and Bangladesh grow increasingly strained, the new Bangladeshi government remains resolute in pursuing Hasina's extradition.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/no-deadline-for-sheikh-hasinas-return-says-indian-high-commissioner-in-bangladesh/articleshow/134661882.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/no-deadline-for-sheikh-hasinas-return-says-indian-high-commissioner-in-bangladesh/articleshow/134661882.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-03T20:36:13+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Pranjal Pandey</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134662005,imgsize-135808.cms"/></item></channel></rss>